  title="Charge Smart, Hear Longer: The Real-Life Science of Hearing Aid Batteries"
  description="Your hearing aids are tiny computers powered by even tinier batteries. Learn how lithium‑ion and zinc‑air batteries really behave, the charging habits that extend lifespan, the travel rules for flights, and the simple moisture and heat routines that keep your devices dependable every day."
